# Solver output directories hold two kinds of file: the *.npz wavefield bulk, which is
# ignored by the repository-root rule, and the small summary.json metrics, which are
# committed. So no directory-level rule here -- an out_*/ entry would take the JSON
# with it.

# Large generated decks. The generator reproduces them in seconds; keeping a 20 MB
# text file in the repository would bloat every clone.
abaqus/ugw_plate_*.inp
